href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Cold\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Cold\">Draconic Elemental Weapon: Cold</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Fire\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp/80px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Fire\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Fire\">Draconic Elemental Weapon: Fire</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Lightning\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp/80px-Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Elemental_Weapon_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Lightning\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Lightning\">Draconic Elemental Weapon: Lightning</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Thunder\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp/80px-Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Elemental_Weapon_Thunder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Thunder\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon: Thunder\">Draconic Elemental Weapon: Thunder</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drakethroat_Glaive\" title=\"Drakethroat Glaive\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Glaive_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Drakethroat_Glaive\" title=\"Drakethroat Glaive\">Drakethroat Glaive</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell can be used to enchant a different weapon instead, by either dropping the intended weapon on the ground then casting the spell on it or by having another party member equip that weapon and cast the spell on them.</li>\n<li>A <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> can target two weapons using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Twinned_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/30px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Twinned_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\">Metamagic: Twinned Spell</a>.</li>\n<li>This spell can target weapons and non-enemy creatures with a weapon in their main hand.</li>\n<li>This effect does not stack with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Elemental Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Elemental Weapon\">Elemental Weapon</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Age\" title=\"Elemental Age\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Age\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Age\" title=\"Elemental Age\">Elemental Age</a>.</li>\n<li>It does stack with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Weapon\" title=\"Magic Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Weapon\" title=\"Magic Weapon\">Magic Weapon</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Cleaver\" title=\"Elemental Cleaver\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Elemental_Cleaver_acid_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Cleaver_acid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Elemental_Cleaver_acid_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Cleaver_acid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Elemental_Cleaver_acid_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Cleaver_acid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Cleaver\" 